(ns phel-doom.io.render.wall-texture-data)

;; Baked from Freedoom (BSD) flat WALL70_2 (64x64), then sanitized to a
;; pure grayscale ramp: the original bake carried colored seam columns, a
;; corrupt top band, and scattered saturated specks that read as colored
;; confetti once sampled across the floor/walls. Walls + floor are grayscale
;; by design (enemy colours pop against neutral stone), so every pixel is
;; clamped into the 232-255 ramp. Re-sanitize, do not hand-edit.

